    - target: {fileID: 7196842992394923673, guid: 75331f2c37b3baf4db4a6a73371bace6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: actions.Array.data[2].description
      value: Hand the player your smokebombs so they can drive the wasps off gently.
        This accepts their help and makes the smokebombs available. Propose only
        once they have sincerely agreed to move the wasps along without harming them,
        not merely asked for the smokebombs or promised to 'deal with it'. If they
        talk about burning the nest, do not hand them over.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
