    I had to jump off the roof to escape the flames. Reckless, but it worked, and
    I am grudgingly impressed.
  witnessFireDescription: The player deliberately set a house in the village on fire
    with a torch to scare Flynn the ranger off its roof.
  ladderReactionIntent: 'React out loud, in character, to the player having just
    raised a ladder against the roof you are stuck on. Protect your pride: you can
    grudgingly acknowledge it, but do not climb down yet unless they have already
    talked you into it.'
  fireReactionIntent: React out loud, in character, having just been forced to jump
    off the roof because the player set the house on fire beneath you.
